SkillDictionary is licensed in two parts.

TOOLING AND SCHEMA — BSD 3-Clause (see LICENSE.BSD-3-Clause)

    skilldict/
    templates/
    schema/
    Makefile

DICTIONARY CONTENT — Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(see LICENSE.CC-BY-SA-4.0)

    data/
    dist/
    docs/

The content files are derived from the RoboCup@Home RuleBook
(https://github.com/RoboCupAtHome/RuleBook), which is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.
Skill descriptions and point values are taken from its scoresheets, so the
share-alike terms carry over and that content cannot be relicensed here.

The rulebook itself is NOT redistributed by this repository; `skilldict pdf`
reads its LaTeX setup from the submodule at build time. It is referenced as
a pinned git submodule at external/RuleBook and remains under its own license.
